</text>
<text x="26" y="205" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="12.5" font-weight="700" fill="#1a3a5c" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-90 26 205)">
Price (cents/liter)
</text>
<g font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#777" text-anchor="end">
